    "detailed_description": "<h1>\u3010Game Content Creation and Streaming Guide\u3011</h1><p>If the content you create contains spoilers for the ending, please be sure to include a notice that it contains spoilers.<br>If you post a link to the game store page in the outline and description of the content you have created, monetization is possible regardless of whether you are an individual or a corporation.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cDamn, I\u2019ve never made clothes before!\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Philosia the Spider Witch lived such an extravagant lifestyle - splurging on designer brands was an everyday occurrence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Her only way to avoid prison is by reopening an old boutique and paying back her debt!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the help of Chirara the Spider Devil left behind by Macria, the boutiques' previous legendary owner, Philosia starts her epic task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the epicenter of fashion and trends, what could be waiting for Philosia on \u2018Royal Street\u2019?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Collect Mysterious Materials\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191570/extras/434e97336997282de43647ee04334e4b.poster.avif?t=1754298246\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191570/extras/434e97336997282de43647ee04334e4b.webm?t=1754298246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To make outfits... Obviously, you need materials!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the world and collect mysterious materials to craft magic outfits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not all materials are easy to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Manufacturing of Materials Using Magic Spinning Wheel and Loom\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manufacture the collected materials with magic and craft threads and fabric.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather various materials and craft cooler items!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Craft Magic Outfits Using the Magical Sewing Machine\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191570/extras/0b3df79b3e33d8c648f792d12d2bdd6b.poster.avif?t=1754298246\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191570/extras/0b3df79b3e33d8c648f792d12d2bdd6b.webm?t=1754298246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191570/extras/0b3df79b3e33d8c648f792d12d2bdd6b.mp4?t=1754298246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can make splendid clothing with manufactured materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As your crafting skills increase, more customers will pop in for a visit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, your first dress might look like a sack at first!...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Requests to Craft Magical Clothing\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s time to take orders for magic outfits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn rewards by crafting outfits for customers with different stories to share.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The higher the quality of your clothing, the more rewards you will collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Decorating the Boutique to be Charming\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customers of Royal Street are crazy for the latest trends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During special seasons and events, decorate your boutique with seasonal wallpaper and decorative items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fame level will increase as the boutique becomes bigger and better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Diverse Episodes\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Philosia runs into unexpected troubles while running the boutique on Royal Street with Chirara the Spider Devil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Philosia the vain Spider Witch's life undergoes big and unexpected changes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What awaits Philosia?</p>",
